SystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">苹果升级商业秘密诉讼并申请禁令，要求阻止OpenAI开发相关AI硬件</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达牵头OSAA成立SAFE工作组，推动AI安全事件共享与开源协作</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek重启第二轮500亿元融资，投前估值升至5000亿元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布 Qwen-Image-3.0-Pro 模型，支持 10px 文字渲染与生成编辑一体化</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ceebdfcbec3ff731e17fdaba0c48808e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里通义千问正式发布 Qwen-Image-3.0-Pro 及 Standard 图像模型，现已上线 Qwen Cloud。该模型在文生图 Arena 榜单中位列中国模型第一、主流模型第二。技术亮点包括支持 4.5k-token 超长提示词、12 种语言覆盖，以及 10px 级别的精细文字渲染能力。架构上，该模型实现了生成与编辑功能的深度融合，无需调用不同模型即可完成改图，显著降低了多语言长文本排版等复杂任务的生产门槛。定价方面，Pro 版单张起价 0.04 美元，Standard 版为 0.03 美元。此次更新通过压扁生产链路，降低了中小团队的调用成本，提升了图像生成与编辑的作业效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌宣布Google Classroom中Gemini功能向全年龄段学生开放</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌宣布自2026年8月10日起，Google Classroom中的Gemini功能将全面向K-12及高等教育学生开放，前提是学校管理员已授予相应权限。此次更新将AI深度集成至学习动线，学生可在Gemini标签页内将课程资料一键转化为抽认卡或练习测验，并支持同步至Gemini Notebook自动生成学习指南与音频概览。核心亮点在于新增的情境化引导提示，学生可针对特定课程及作业要求，让Gemini结合教学大纲提供针对性辅导，而非通用对话。此举旨在通过贴合课程上下文的交互，辅助学生完成论文写作等真实学习任务，显著提升AI在教育场景下的实用性与精准度。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果升级商业秘密诉讼并申请禁令，要求阻止OpenAI开发相关AI硬件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/83807af47da4e4f3dc77343838cccea4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果近日向法院申请初步禁令，要求限制OpenAI继续开发涉嫌使用苹果技术的AI设备及相关产品，并申请加快针对OpenAI、其旗下基金会、AI硬件初创公司io，以及OpenAI高管Chang Liu、Tang Yew Tan等方的取证程序。苹果调查发现，除此前涉案人员外，另有11名前苹果员工可能掌握关键证据，包括面试前泄露未发布产品专有信息及截取机密文件等行为。此外，多名OpenAI员工主动归还离职时保留的苹果设备，加剧了苹果对知识产权泄露范围的担忧。OpenAI对此回应称，苹果申请禁令基于虚假信息且毫无必要，强调公司未获取也无意获取苹果商业秘密，并反驳苹果在权限管理及邮件发送方面存在漏洞。此次法律攻防升级，将对AI硬件领域的知识产权保护及行业竞争格局产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达牵头OSAA成立SAFE工作组，推动AI安全事件共享与开源协作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/df6e2b264a845e8866cb9de8ca1699c7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达牵头成立的开放安全人工智能联盟（OSAA）正式组建“共享人工智能发现交流”（SAFE）工作组，由Linux基金会管理，旨在建立AI网络安全事件保密报告、受影响对象通知及无责复盘分析机制。OSAA目前成员已超120家，包括Adobe、思科、微软及Visa等，重点通过开源协作提升AI安全能力。在技术贡献方面，英伟达提供开源LLM漏洞扫描工具Garak，Okta推进Agent身份技术，红帽研发Agent治理方案，亚马逊则贡献Strands Agents与授权语言Cedar。该联盟计划形成可供企业部署的开源AI安全工具链，以保护AI智能体并防御恶意攻击。尽管OpenAI、Anthropic和谷歌尚未加入，但OSAA的快速落地反映了行业对开源AI监管及安全标准建设的迫切需求，旨在通过开放共享强化开源AI生态的产业竞</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek重启第二轮500亿元融资，投前估值升至5000亿元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5314a732c3c072c146a3d9b6342f3f81.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">国内AI大模型企业DeepSeek已正式重启第二轮融资，计划募资500亿元，投前估值达5000亿元，预计8月下旬完成签约。若本轮顺利交割，DeepSeek两轮累计募资将突破1000亿元，估值较今年6月完成的首轮融资（估值超3500亿元）提升约43%。DeepSeek首轮融资同样募资500亿元，吸引了国家人工智能产业投资基金、腾讯、宁德时代、网易、京东及IDG资本等机构参投。由于首轮意向资金曾超1000亿元，大量候补资金方顺延至本轮。此次融资重启反映了在算力竞争加剧背景下，资本对国产大模型技术迭代与商业化潜力的持续看好。超千亿规模的资金注入将进一步巩固DeepSeek的行业领先地位，并加剧国内AI大模型梯队的分化，推动高算力壁垒的构建。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
